### Health check
GET http://localhost:8082/

### Open a new bank account
POST http://localhost:8082/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "John Doe",
  "initialDeposit": 1000.00
}

### Deposit money (replace with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00
}

### Withdraw money (replace with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200.00
}

### Get account (replace with actual ID) — state rebuilt from events
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Close account (replace with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{accountId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer request"
}
